		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A 30-foot-long purplish flesh funnel of eyes, mouths, and sensory organs. Destructive beasts that seek carnage.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 43, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 tentacle +7 (1d8) or wind burst, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Deflecting Winds</strong>. Ranged attacks against polyp have DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sucking Wind</strong>. As an action, can create an inward vortex. All creatures within distant, half movement if moving away from polyp.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wind Burst</strong>. All creatures within near of polyp, DEX 15+ or 3d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
